      {
        "id": "p_report",
        "title": "Report",
        "kind": "report",
        "body": "# The seven fixes\n\n## U1 — a toned header, both times\n\nThis table is embedded plainly. Its header row is shaded.\n\n![[Formatted]]\n\n\\pagebreak\n\nAnd this one is embedded with `|fit`. Before the fix **only this one** had a toned header, which read as `fit` adding something; it was the other way round — `fit` was the only path that worked.\n\n![[Formatted|fit]]\n\nThe icons, the status colours and the revenue sort all print here too — the page and the card are drawn from the same rules.\n",
        "tiles": []
